    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nih giidaheachta Yesu Gristo gil, ghayi adaw ASEETA niny goohiimsa soomjoagaaschi ng'asheega jea gabay ghwahidu; ak ghwanung' eanal aba giijeakteayda malaykajeandaanyi gaweesa soomjeandaanyi was Yohana, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amadu gamuuwu Yohana iita ng'asheanda ASEETA ea muuwuunooda iita Yesu Gristo, ea iita haleanjeeda sean ghayi dea. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghang'wana siida asoamwa aba ghuuta haw ng'asheega was ramoorangeasu, ak ghang'wana fugiga iiyiin, ea dea ang'waay ng'asheega sing'oorsa jeedean; aba gideaba damanda nineekiit.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Giighacheeka weesa ganiisajeega asispwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yohana heeda ganiisajeega asispwa mida Asiya: Gagasa anyasa dagheerjeanduumeeda ea hoyyooyda leabu heeda dea mida ea dea bean gwanda dea jea ghwahidu, leabu heeda gurooruunat ispwa mida madeeda hoorgeadaanyi bea sugoocheanduumeeda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "biissa gwaleabu heeda Yesu Gristoyda was muushoocheanda doabiiwaat, was duweacheeda fuga nimeewa, ak goombal sugoodiga mida ng'eanyiida.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heedeaba ninyeeda bwariinyeasa ak gootineasa eeheelleewana riing'eegaasa aba foojeandaanyi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gagoaneasa sugoocheanduumeeda, ak geahuuyi ashoohoodiga aba heeda ASEATAANYI ea Ghweanda, giigheambiita daanyi ea sugoocheanduumeeda ea ghoah damanda manda muudeanooda. Amin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ula, ghwaan nea goodeana shamooghuutka, ak gayghwadaah niny giliwas gheang'da, ea giliwas sih ghayi ng'ut niny; ea eemoojiga sean bea ng'eanyiida gaygagutu heareagaaschi. Asaha. Amin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aniini geawooschi Alfa ea Omega,” dea madeeda ea dea huuydean, aba ginyah Ng'utamiida was ASEETA, dea mida ea dea bean gwanda ea dea jea ghwahidu, was ASEETA mideawa uurda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aniini geawooschi Yohana, orjeeda giyeang'wa deaghayi oopareanyeewi sawanadeeda ea sugoocheanduumeeda ea milikghteayda nea ghoahang'waanyi, nea gwanda ng'eanyiida neaweesa beega siguura Batmo aba badayda ng'asheanda ASEETA ea muuwuunooda ng'asheega Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchu geandi jeeda Guroorooda eaweeda Ng'utamiida, hean ghayiinyi nyeashta haw aba badaydeanya, nyaashta giiguuleanda nea gwayi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ng'oorsiina haleanjeeda idaahi jeeda gitaabu ak giyeasi ganiisajeega asispwa, dea Efeso ea Smirna ea Bergamo ea Diyatira, ea Sardi ea Filadelfiya ea Laodikiya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghaayamnyi geaw dadaah nyeashtida abaloolaniin, hean ghaadaayi gheaboonyan ispwa meeng'meeng'i mida deageaw, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ghaadaayi aba dang'adigeaba hoorgajeegiga siida uurji orjeeda siida, nea nishuup hang'da gulng'eanyi, ak ea nirassa daghataanyi inyeashta sisna dahaabu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "uhuudaanyi ea buudeagaaschi ea eashish ea ghawaar gea gisilleanda eesh, ea eashish ea ghawaar gapkeanda; nea gheanyangaaschi ghawaar ng'ushapta beasta, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak geeshangaaschi gawuurji gharinyeanda mur sisiy muuchi ea gawuurji gilisiihuuna duwayda beasta, nea fuydaanyi ghwanyaashta dea beega saang'a; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ghoang'waanya miin ispwa aba geatindaanyi bea dugwa, ak gwarina ghuutaanyi ng'uta shidaat meadajeega sean, ak gheamamdaanyi gawuurji aseeta dagu muuchi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghaadaayi niny, geabeedeaysi geeshangaaschi ea dawuurji siida nimi. Hean ghwayiin geatindaanyi bea dugwa uhuudeanyu nea gwayi, “Adibeali, Aniini geawooschi dea madeeda ea dea huuydean ea dea majeek; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ghayi ghaameayi, ak ging'ulayi geawooschi majeek; ghayi ghaameayi, asi ng'ula geawooschi majeek damanda manda muudeanooda, ak geandeawi gisiitina gidaghuuta Miyeeda ea Gheeda maloonghajeega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ng'oara haleanjeeni idaahiin, ea gea ghamneawa mida, ea gea iidu jea gabassa iing'ata suh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Makcheameedeaba miingiga as ispwa ideaksi geatindeanyu bea dugwean, ea hoorgajeegiga as ispwa meeng'meeng'iin, miingiga as ispwaan, malaykajeega ganiisajeegiga as ispwaan ak eara hoorgajeegiga as ispwa meeng'meeng'iin ea ganiisajeegiga asispwaan gil.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
